'''Death Walk''' is a [[skill]] granted by [[Bubonic Trail]].

==Mechanics==
Death Walk is affected by [[socket]]ed support gems regardless of whether they are [[link]]ed. However, since Death Walk is not granted by a skill gem, it cannot be supported by {{il|Empower Support}}, {{il|Enhance Support}}, or {{il|Enlighten Support}}.

Using [[Cyclone]] does not count as "walking" for purposes of Death Walk.

